      {
        "id": 126751,
        "name": "Pydro",
        "username": "Pydro",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pydro/{size}/1844_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-11T03:52:26.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The second sentence is meant to apply to any target. You play titles under targets. When that target leaves play, you suddenly have titles that aren’t under anything, so they go back.</p>\n<p>The first sentence is meant for any strange card that might affect the deck, just to make sure nothing strange happens.</p>",
