        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/kharnel/{size}/1984_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-11T03:53:07.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>In fact, I think the first sentence is the one that applies mainly to Kaargra, since her card reads \"When Kaargra Warfang would be destroyed,&nbsp;destroy any Title cards under her cards and flip her villain character cards instead.\" So any Titles that Kaargra has while she's a target and loses should go back to the Title deck.</p><p>I imagine they mentioned \"discarded or destroyed\" for weird edge-case situations like Setback's Fumbling Fool discarding the top card of each deck. Fanatic's End of Days would also destroy any Title cards in play, and they would then be shuffled back into the deck.</p>",
